{"title": "加缪全集．第1卷，小说", "index": 3, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre\" id=\"1T140-bc538528c7ce47ffb4237b0cee7bfe08\">\n<p class=\"picture\"><img alt=\"alt\" class=\"calibre2\" src=\"../images/00001.jpeg\"/></p>\n<p class=\"tz\">十四岁时的加缪</p>\n<p class=\"picture\"><img alt=\"alt\" class=\"calibre2\" src=\"../images/00002.jpeg\"/></p>\n<p class=\"tz\">加缪（后排右起第二）大学期间师生合影</p>\n<p class=\"picture\"><img alt=\"alt\" class=\"calibre2\" src=\"../images/00003.jpeg\"/></p>\n<p class=\"tz\">加缪记者证上的照片</p>\n<p class=\"picture\"><img alt=\"alt\" class=\"calibre2\" src=\"../images/00004.jpeg\"/></p>\n<p class=\"tz\">加缪在奥兰</p>\n<p class=\"picture\"><img alt=\"alt\" class=\"calibre2\" src=\"../images/00005.jpeg\"/></p>\n<p class=\"tz\">摄影家伊齐为加缪拍摄的照片</p>\n<p class=\"picture\"><img alt=\"alt\" class=\"calibre2\" src=\"../images/00006.jpeg\"/></p>\n<p class=\"tz\">加缪在瑞士莱森</p>\n<p class=\"picture\"><img alt=\"alt\" class=\"calibre2\" src=\"../images/00007.jpeg\"/></p>\n<p class=\"tz\">摄影家亨利·卡蒂埃-布勒松为加缪拍摄的照片</p>\n<p class=\"picture\"><img alt=\"alt\" class=\"calibre2\" src=\"../images/00008.jpeg\"/></p>\n<p class=\"tz\">加缪手持戏剧《闹鬼》中的一个道具面具</p>\n<p class=\"picture\"><img alt=\"alt\" class=\"calibre2\" src=\"../images/00009.jpeg\"/></p>\n<p class=\"tz\">加缪星期日在街头</p>\n<p class=\"picture\"><img alt=\"alt\" class=\"calibre2\" src=\"../images/00010.jpeg\"/></p>\n<p class=\"tz\">1945年11月，加缪在布日瓦尔的住所外</p>\n<p class=\"picture\"><img alt=\"alt\" class=\"calibre2\" src=\"../images/00011.jpeg\"/></p>\n<p class=\"tz\">加缪在宾馆房间内</p>\n<p class=\"picture\"><img alt=\"alt\" class=\"calibre2\" src=\"../images/00012.jpeg\"/></p>\n<p class=\"tz\">纽约留影</p>\n<p class=\"picture\"><img alt=\"alt\" class=\"calibre2\" src=\"../images/00013.jpeg\"/></p>\n<p class=\"tz\">逝世前一年的加缪</p>\n<p class=\"picture\"><img alt=\"alt\" class=\"calibre2\" src=\"../images/00014.jpeg\"/></p>\n<p class=\"tz\">加缪的墓地</p>\n<p class=\"picture\"><img alt=\"alt\" class=\"calibre2\" src=\"../images/00015.jpeg\"/></p>\n<p class=\"tz\">阿尔及利亚友人立在蒂帕札的纪念碑，碑上文字意为：“在这儿我领悟了人们所说的光荣：就是无拘无束的爱的权利。”</p>\n</body>"}]}